DATA SOURCES

This software may optionally fetch data from:
- Tor Onionoo API (https://onionoo.torproject.org/)
  - Public relay directory information
  - No authentication required
  - Subject to Tor Project's terms of service

Users are responsible for complying with the Tor Project's terms and 
acceptable use policies when accessing their APIs.

